 it tackles a problem you've probably lived with: the critical process that=
 runs on a spreadsheet nobody wants to touch.=3D=3D

=20

You know the setup. A spreadsheet three people edit. A text thread nobody c=
an search. An inbox where approvals disappear. It holds together because so=
meone holds it together.

   =20

**Meet **[**Pave**](https://www.quickbase.com/pave?utm_source=3DTechPresso&=
