Feature)**, Quickbase's AI app builder.** Describe the work in plain Englis=
h, and Pave builds a real app: the data, the roles, the workflows and the h=
osting. No developer, no ticket, no waiting.

  =20

=E2=96=B6 [Watch Pave in 30 seconds](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3Do9cH=
t6HdDoQ)

   =20

Here's a real prompt from Pave's demo: _"Build a project intake tracker for=
 new requests, pending review and unassigned work."_ Pave came back with an=
 intake app, a dashboard and an approval workflow, and started building.

   =20

Why it's worth a look:

   =20

=E2=9C=85 **Approvals that don't vanish.** Describe a two-step sign-off onc=
e, and nothing sits approved without an owner.

=20

=F0=9F=94=8C **Connected from day one.** Pave plugs into Salesforce, NetSui=
te, Slack, Workday and 350+ native connectors, so data moves on its own ins=
tead of getting copy-pasted between tabs.

=20

=F0=9F=94=92 **IT can say yes.** Permissions ship with every app, and your =
data never trains the AI.

   =20

Pave runs on the Quickbase platform: 5,000+ companies, 25+ years in operati=
ons. And one managing director of quality systems says they built three app=
s in about 10 hours, between meetings.

   =20

